# Diagnostic / scratch artifacts dumped at the REPO ROOT during live sessions
# (Ola 4 housekeeping, 2026-06-01). These are throwaway outputs of one-off
# repro/diag runs — NOT artifacts-with-a-recipe and NOT source. Every pattern
# is anchored with a leading "/" so it ONLY matches the repo root and never
# shadows the TRACKED diagnostic tools under scripts/ (scripts/_diag/*.py,
# scripts/_arch_dep_graph.py, ...) or Testing Inicial/bench/_*.py.
